### Create Task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Spring Boot",
  "completed": false
}

### Get All Tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### Get Task By Id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1

### Invalid Task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "completed": false
}
###
# Get Non-Existent Task
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/4

### Update Task
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Spring Boot - Updated",
  "completed": true
}

### Delete Task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/6

### Verify Delete
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/6

### Test auth
GET http://localhost:8080/auth-demo

